    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "A release",
     "texto": [
      "**Produser merilis film ini** means \"The producer releases this film\". In this form, meN- expresses the action the subject performs."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Classifiers",
     "texto": [
      "**Seorang** is used with a person, **sebuah** with an object and **seekor** with an animal. English uses \"a\" in all three cases, but Indonesian distinguishes these categories."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
